WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.803 --> 00:00:07.054
Costs shows what your agents cost, worked out from the tokens every shift used, and what they delivered for it.

2
00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:17.861
Open Costs in the sidebar. Only Owners and Admins see it. Choose a range: this month, the last 30 days or last month, or pick your own dates and a project.

3
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:23.189
Total spend sums every shift in the range, and By day charts it day by day.

4
00:00:23.893 --> 00:00:36.906
By project splits the spend per project. The meter shows how much of this month’s budget a project has used: the web shop is at about eighty percent. The project name opens its settings, where the budget is set.

5
00:00:37.606 --> 00:00:41.702
By agent and By model show who used the tokens, and on which model.

6
00:00:42.413 --> 00:00:51.736
What the agents delivered puts the cost next to the work: cards finished, an estimate of the hours a person would have needed, and how that compares with last month.

7
00:00:52.442 --> 00:01:02.981
Export CSV downloads every shift in the range for your own spreadsheet. Under Currency and prices you set the currency and its rate, and see the list prices used.

8
00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:08.736
That is the Costs page: see what the work costs, and keep each project within its budget.
